PR Title: fix leftover from CLK_14M cleanup

PR Description:
The RTL hierarchy tab in GOWIN FPGA Designer displayed an error: "ERROR EX3813 : 'CLK_14M' is not declared under prefix 'Primary'" at rtl/src/peripheral/msx/bus.sv line 194.

The CLK_14M signal from the BUS_IF interface had been removed in a prior commit addressing issue #7 ("Synchronize the operating clock with the bus clock"). This PR removes the orphaned assignment that was still referencing the deleted signal.

The contributor noted uncertainty about why the assignment didn't trigger synthesis errors during bitstream compilation.

PR Comments:
- herraa1 (contributor, Sep 23, 2024): Provided the PR description detailing the error condition and rationale for the fix.
- buppu3 (maintainer, Sep 24, 2024): "This module was not being used anywhere so it was not showing as a fatal error."

Linked Issue #7 Title: "V9990 の DVI 出力がビデオキャプチャーできない"

Linked Issue #7 Body:
- Source URL: https://github.com/buppu3/tnCart/issues/7

GC533(HDMI ビデオキャプチャー)の最新ファームウェアでキャプチャができなくなった。
V9990 エミュレーションのドットクロックタイミングは MSX バスクロックから生成しているが、MSX バスクロック (約3.58MHz) と DIV ドットクロック(27Mhz) の同期がとれず、VSYNC のタイミングがフレーム毎にブレてしまい信号が安定しない為。

